Package: yamaanative
Title: Native Boundary Prototype for yamaa
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ming-Chun", "Chen", email = "hellomingchun@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Optional installation, lossless scalar transport and bounded numeric
    application interfaces for the shared yamaa Rust core. Validates native
    host boundaries without evaluating specifications or tables.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.6.1)
SystemRequirements: Cargo, rustc (>= 1.90.0), GNU make
NeedsCompilation: yes
